       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SKPCH.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           C01 IS SKPCH01.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT LP-FILE ASSIGN TO LPFILE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  LP-FILE.
       01  LP-REC       PIC X(80).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  HEAD1        PIC X(80) VALUE 'REPORT'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN OUTPUT LP-FILE.
           WRITE LP-REC FROM HEAD1 AFTER SKPCH01.
           WRITE LP-REC FROM HEAD1 AFTER ADVANCING SKPCH01.
           CLOSE LP-FILE.
           STOP RUN.
